WEBVTT

00:07:29.742 --> 00:07:31.873
I pull myself up into the branches,

00:07:31.873 --> 00:07:35.356
and as I come out of the water,
I look over my shoulder.

00:07:35.356 --> 00:07:37.276
My leg from the knee down

00:07:37.276 --> 00:07:39.204
is mangled beyond description.

00:07:39.204 --> 00:07:40.599
The bone is cracked.

00:07:40.599 --> 00:07:42.429
The meat is torn up.

00:07:42.429 --> 00:07:47.029
I make an instant decision that
I'll never look at that again.

00:07:47.029 --> 00:07:49.413
As I come out of the water,

00:07:49.413 --> 00:07:52.030
Solly arrives at a deep section,

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:53.655
a channel between us.

00:07:53.655 --> 00:07:55.793
He knows, he sees the state of my leg,

00:07:55.793 --> 00:07:57.639
he knows that between him and I

00:07:57.639 --> 00:07:58.851
there is a crocodile,

00:07:58.851 --> 00:08:01.343
and I can tell you this man doesn't
slow down for one second.